        "id": 2606027393,
        "content": "Few remarks:\r\n- The buttons seem too transparent on my monitor so maybe we could make them a bit more visible.\r\n- The error messages that appear at the bottom of the page are white, but I think they should be red and a bit bigger to emphasize that something went wrong. Also the field that is invalid for example `EVM Wallet Private Key` could be red along with the error message\r\n- There's no way to close the config modal\r\n- Network dropdown has Optimism twice and Gnosis is not listed\r\nThis may be out of scope because it's a task only for styling but I noticed:\r\n- When you refresh the page, you need to login with github every time\r\n- When clicking `Confirm`, I get this error: `Error: Not Found - https://docs.github.com/rest/orgs/orgs#list-app-installations-for-an-organization`",
